  "Deal <color\\=#fffc40>$1</color> ATK Gun damage to 1 foe, with a $2 fixed chance to inflict the foe with [Marked]: Decrease DEF by <color\\=#fffc40>$3</color> for $4 turns.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#024068>The firing pin strikes the bullet at high speed and detonates the gunpowder, firing a deadly shot through the smoke that deals Gun damage. Increase damage if the enemy is Marked.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal <color\\=#fffc40>$1</color> ATK Gun damage to 1 foe, with a $2 fixed chance to inflict the foe with [Marked]: Decrease DEF by <color\\=#fffc40>$3</color> for $4 turns.": "",
  "Deal <color\\=#fffc40>$2</color> ATK Gun damage to all foes $1 times. If there is a foe with [Marked], increase skill ATK by <color\\=#fffc40>$3</color> and Crit DMG by <color\\=#fffc40>$4</color>.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#024068>The moment the Axe Gun catches the shadow of a foe, time seems to stop for a moment, and the bullets that come out of the Axe Gun mercilessly penetrate the foe, dealing multiple damage to the foe group.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal <color\\=#FFFF00>$1</color> ATK Fire damage to 1 foe, with a <color\\=#FFFF00>$2</color> base chance to inflict <link\\=s|102><u>Burn</u></link>, double the chance if there are no foes with <link\\=s|102><u>Burn</u></link>.": "",
