  "Deal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#fffc40>$2</color> of ATK ($1 hits). Inflict [Trauma] for $3 turns. When [Trauma] is active, each time the target takes 1 hit of Fire damage, increase their Crit DMG Taken by $4 for $5 turns. Stacks up to $6 times.": "",
